86; PDF pp. 506–508; local complement-class notation"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_numbering","html":"local-catalog; not book numbering"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§13.1–13.3 and §13.7, pp. 320–343, 362–364; local machine/certificate/coding interfaces"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\mathbf2\">\\(\\Sigma=\\mathbf2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NP}\">\\(\\mathrm{NP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ee6e992ddf35c1d4\" href=\"?note=ee6e992ddf35c1d4\" title=\"73-df-np-and-verifier-notation\">73-df-np-and-verifier-notation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline L\">\\(\\overline L\\)</span> 的全集明确为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2^*\">\\(\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>；补集函数的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\mathbf2^*)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\mathbf2^*)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.7}\\vdash\n\\overline L\\coloneqq\\mathbf2^*\\setminus L,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Co\\mathrm{}NP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\overline L\\in\\mathrm{NP}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.7}\\vdash\n\\overline L\\coloneqq\\mathbf2^*\\setminus L,\\qquad